{"texts":[{"text":"Certains passages sont bien cachés : n’hésitez pas à fouiller partout, observer les recoins et suivre les détails que le","bbox":{"x":146,"y":834,"w":1147,"h":29},"fontFamily":"Lato, arial","fontSize":"19px","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","lineHeight":"28.5px","textTransform":"none","color":"#f2f2f7","textAlign":"start"},{"text":"N’hésitez pas à revenir sur vos pas : certains lieux révèlent de nouveaux chemins quand le monde a changé.","bbox":{"x":284,"y":834,"w":873,"h":29},"fontFamily":"Lato, arial","fontSize":"19px","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","lineHeight":"28.5px","textTransform":"none","color":"#f2f2f7","textAlign":"start"},{"text":"Parlez aux voyageurs que vous croisez : leurs mots sont parfois des portes, et leurs silences des indices.","bbox":{"x":299,"y":834,"w":842,"h":29},"fontFamily":"Lato, arial","fontSize":"19px","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","lineHeight":"28.5px","textTransform":"none","color":"#f2f2f7","textAlign":"start"},{"text":"Le Golem de Vigie peut grandement vous aider dans la quête : écoutez ce que la mer lui apprend.","bbox":{"x":326,"y":834,"w":788,"h":29},"fontFamily":"Lato, arial","fontSize":"19px","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","lineHeight":"28.5px","textTransform":"none","color":"#f2f2f7","textAlign":"start"},{"text":"Utilisez les flèches directionnelles, ainsi que la souris, pour jouer.","bbox":{"x":396,"y":819,"w":529,"h":29},"fontFamily":"Lato, arial","fontSize":"19px","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","lineHeight":"28.5px","textTransform":"none","color":"#f2f2f7","textAlign":"start"},{"text":"Vous pouvez utiliser une manette de jeu pour jouer.","bbox":{"x":460,"y":819,"w":421,"h":29},"fontFamily":"Lato, arial","fontSize":"19px","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","lineHeight":"28.5px","textTransform":"none","color":"#f2f2f7","textAlign":"start"},{"text":"Souris / Clavier · Gamepad · Touch","bbox":{"x":0,"y":137,"w":280,"h":23},"fontFamily":"